<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG has issued two million American-style call warrants, on the Genussscheine of Roche Holding AG, lead manager Dresdner Bank (Schweiz) AG said.</p>
<p>200 warrants control one Genussschein.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    13,000.00 CHF	   PREMIUM	20.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.25 CHF		  GEARING	11.1 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 05.FEB.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	04.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  11,700.00 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
